WEBVTT

00:44:58.752 --> 00:45:01.696
who have been doing
routine work for decades

00:45:01.720 --> 00:45:06.370
now faced with a world
with very few routine work left.

00:45:06.728 --> 00:45:11.412
I certainly believe
AI will create more jobs,

00:45:11.436 --> 00:45:17.475
but this requires a massive amount
of planning and resources and cost

00:45:17.499 --> 00:45:20.804
and a mentality shift from the society.

00:45:20.828 --> 00:45:25.837
So I worry, are we going to be
able to shift fast enough

00:45:25.861 --> 00:45:31.057
and prepare for this future world
in which the routine jobs are displaced.